 had.\nHear\, O Israel: the Lord is our God\, the Lord is One. (Deuteronomy
  6:4)\n\nThe Torah says to speak these words "when you lie down and when y
 ou rise up" (Deuteronomy 6:7)\, so many people say the Shema just before s
 leep.\n\nPlease keep your streak going. You're doing awesome!\nOpen Aleph:
